X:1
T:Battle Hymn of the Republic
T:Mine Eyes Have Seen the Glory
C:American folk song / William Steffe; words by Julia Ward Howe
S:Music: CCEH tune 000510, Battle Hymn, four-part score
S:Text: The Public Domain Song Anthology (Berger/Israels, 2020), printed p.38 / PDF p.58
Z:Composite edition: CCEH music with the previously retained first stanza and refrain
N:Four editorial SATB tracks separate the upper and lower notes of each source staff; the source does not name SATB parts.
N:Music preserves CCEH's B-flat key, untied pickup, sustained cadences and three-beat final bar. No anthology chord layer is retained.
N:CCEH supplies no lyrics. Every prior lyric field and its pitched-event underlay is retained; no additional stanzas are introduced.
N:CCEH declares the music and files public domain; the historical harmonizer and printed edition are unidentified. No blanket worldwide clearance is claimed.
N:Retained anthology text: underlying US public-domain assertion; new anthology contributions CC0 1.0.
